      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOUD MOUTH LARRY (3) is yet to miss the placings in six starts including two wins and finished in the minor money again last time when second (25.88) over 457m at this track. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. CURTIS KEEPING (2) used the rails draw to advantage to get home last time at Dubbo over 400m (22.82) after forging to the front and leading throughout, scoring by 5.5 lengths. Must include in calculations. BLUE SWALLOW (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when eighth at this track over 457m behind All Edge (26.78) in a Grade 5. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in six starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. PAW KITTY (6) should be thereabouts.",
